OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy with hill fog and
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain at first. Dry with
OL,7,Fsunny spells from late morning.
OL,8,FIncreasingly windy and cloudy
OL,9,Fovernight, with rain and snow on
OL,10,Fhigher ground. Cold.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fand unsettled, with spells of rain and
OL,14,Fstrong winds at times Tuesday and
OL,15,FWednesday. Perhaps drier and brighter
OL,16,FThursday. Remaining generally cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
